WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The same face can look different
when you turn it around.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1980 a famous illusion
made that surprise impossible to ignore.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later studies found the effect could persist
with only the eyes or mouth shown.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The observation survived,
but a simple explanation needed refining.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A neuroscience-sounding promise
still needs direct product testing.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free routine, read the sources,
then decide for yourself.
